---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.jsx';
import ScrollReveal from '../../components/ScrollReveal.jsx';
---

<Layout title="Cosmic IQ — Nithish">
  <Navbar client:load />

  <article class="pt-[72px]">
    <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-16 md:py-28">
      
      <ScrollReveal client:load>
        <a href="/projects" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px] font-medium tracking-[0.06em] uppercase text-charcoal-muted hover:text-charcoal transition-colors duration-300 mb-14" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"/></svg>
          All Projects
        </a>
      </ScrollReveal>

      <ScrollReveal client:load delay={0.1}>
        <div class="mb-14 md:mb-20">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-medium tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-charcoal-muted block mb-4" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">Project 01</span>
          <h1 class="text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4.5rem)] font-800 tracking-[-0.03em] leading-[0.95] mb-6" style="font-family: Archivo, sans-serif;">
            Cosmic IQ
          </h1>
          <p class="text-[15px] text-charcoal-muted max-w-[500px] leading-[1.8] mb-6" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 300;">
            An enterprise-grade SaaS platform for workforce intelligence — measuring 
            capabilities, mapping skills development, automating technical assessments, 
            and predicting talent attrition using AI-derived insights.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="tag-pill">React</span>
            <span class="tag-pill">TypeScript</span>
            <span class="tag-pill">Spring Boot</span>
            <span class="tag-pill">PostgreSQL</span>
            <span class="tag-pill">Docker</span>
            <span class="tag-pill">Framer Motion</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </ScrollReveal>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 md:gap-6">
        <aside class="md:col-span-3">
          <ScrollReveal client:visible>
            <div class="space-y-7">
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-[11px] font-medium tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-charcoal-muted mb-2" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">Role</h4>
                <p class="text-[14px] text-charcoal-light" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">Full-Stack Developer</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-[11px] font-medium tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-charcoal-muted mb-2" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">Timeline</h4>
                <p class="text-[14px] text-charcoal-light" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">2025</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-[11px] font-medium tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-charcoal-muted mb-2" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">Type</h4>
                <p class="text-[14px] text-charcoal-light" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">Enterprise SaaS Platform</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-[11px] font-medium tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-charcoal-muted mb-2" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">Links</h4>
                <a href="https://github.com/l-nithish" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] text-charcoal-light hover:text-terracotta transition-colors duration-300" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">
                  <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.3 3.44 9.8 8.2 11.38.6.1.82-.26.82-.58v-2.03c-3.34.72-4.04-1.6-4.04-1.6-.54-1.38-1.33-1.75-1.33-1.75-1.08-.74.08-.72.08-.72 1.2.08 1.82 1.22 1.82 1.22 1.06 1.82 2.78 1.3 3.46 1 .1-.77.42-1.3.76-1.6-2.66-.3-5.46-1.33-5.46-5.9 0-1.3.46-2.36 1.22-3.2-.12-.3-.53-1.52.12-3.16 0 0 1-.32 3.3 1.22a11.5 11.5 0 013-.4c1.02.004 2.04.14 3 .4 2.28-1.54 3.28-1.22 3.28-1.22.66 1.64.24 2.86.12 3.16.76.84 1.22 1.9 1.22 3.2 0 4.58-2.8 5.6-5.48 5.9.44.38.82 1.1.82 2.22v3.3c0 .32.22.7.82.58C20.56 21.8 24 17.3 24 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/></svg>
                  GitHub
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </ScrollReveal>
        </aside>

        <div class="md:col-span-9 md:col-start-5">
          <div class="max-w-[600px]" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">
            <ScrollReveal client:visible>
              <h3 class="text-[clamp(1.2rem,2vw,1.6rem)] font-600 tracking-[-0.01em] mb-4" style="font-family: Archivo, sans-serif;">Overview</h3>
              <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.9] text-charcoal-light font-light mb-4">
                Traditional HR systems only track basic metadata — name, hire date, salary. They 
                fail to answer critical business questions about actual skill capacity, operational 
                risks from skill gaps, or how to scientifically measure employee growth.
              </p>
              <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.9] text-charcoal-light font-light">
                Cosmic IQ solves this by creating a skills-first intelligence layer that acts 
                as the operating system for workforce capability mapping. The platform serves 
                three distinct user roles — Employees, Managers, and Administrators — each 
                with dedicated dashboards and functionality.
              </p>
            </ScrollReveal>

            <div class="divider my-10"></div>

            <ScrollReveal client:visible>
              <h3 class="text-[clamp(1.2rem,2vw,1.6rem)] font-600 tracking-[-0.01em] mb-4" style="font-family: Archivo, sans-serif;">Key Features</h3>
              <ul class="space-y-3 mb-4">
                <li class="text-[14px] leading-[1.8] text-charcoal-light font-light flex items-start gap-3">
                  <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-terracotta mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
                  Role-based dashboards for Employees, Managers, and Administrators with dedicated workflows
                </li>
                <li class="text-[14px] leading-[1.8] text-charcoal-light font-light flex items-start gap-3">
                  <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-terracotta mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
                  AI-powered skills gap heatmap comparing target vs. actual department competencies
                </li>
                <li class="text-[14px] leading-[1.8] text-charcoal-light font-light flex items-start gap-3">
                  <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-terracotta mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
                  Real-time assessment engine with countdown timer and auto-grading
                </li>
                <li class="text-[14px] leading-[1.8] text-charcoal-light font-light flex items-start gap-3">
                  <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-terracotta mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
                  Executive analytics dashboard with custom Recharts visualizations (bar, pie, line)
                </li>
                <li class="text-[14px] leading-[1.8] text-charcoal-light font-light flex items-start gap-3">
                  <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-terracotta mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
                  JWT authentication with silent access/refresh token rotation
                </li>
                <li class="text-[14px] leading-[1.8] text-charcoal-light font-light flex items-start gap-3">
                  <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-terracotta mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
                  Career pathway recommendations identifying promotion-ready employees
                </li>
              </ul>
            </ScrollReveal>

            <div class="divider my-10"></div>

            <ScrollReveal client:visible>
              <h3 class="text-[clamp(1.2rem,2vw,1.6rem)] font-600 tracking-[-0.01em] mb-4" style="font-family: Archivo, sans-serif;">Technical Architecture</h3>
              <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.9] text-charcoal-light font-light mb-4">
                The frontend is built with React 19 and TypeScript, powered by Vite for 
                fast HMR development. Framer Motion handles smooth micro-animations across 
                all page transitions. Recharts renders custom SVG data visualizations.
              </p>
              <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.9] text-charcoal-light font-light">
                The backend runs on Java 17 with Spring Boot 3, using Spring Security for 
                stateless JWT authentication and Spring Data JPA with Hibernate for the 
                persistence layer. PostgreSQL serves as the database with UUID-based primary 
                keys, relational mapping, and logical soft-deletes. The entire stack is 
                containerized with Docker and deployed via Vercel (frontend), Render 
                (backend), and Neon.tech (serverless PostgreSQL).
              </p>
            </ScrollReveal>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <footer class="border-t border-charcoal/[0.06] py-8">
    <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <span class="text-[12px] text-charcoal-muted tracking-[0.04em]" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">© 2026 Nithish</span>
      <a href="/projects" class="text-[12px] text-charcoal-muted hover:text-charcoal tracking-[0.04em] uppercase transition-colors duration-300" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">Back to Projects</a>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>
